---
import Layout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/ui/Section.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
import HeroBanner from "../components/ui/HeroBanner.astro";
import Heading from "../components/ui/Heading.astro";
import ProgressBar from "../components/ui/ProgressBar.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../components/ui/Eyebrow.astro";
import VideoAstroComponent from "../components/ui/Video.astro";
import Audio from "../components/ui/Audio.astro";
import radioImage from "../assets/images/new_ReliabilityRadioweb-logo.jpg";
import Accordion from "../components/ui/Accordion.astro";

const accordionItems = [
  {
    title: "360 Precision Assessment",
    content:
      `The first ever assessment organized into multi-layers, allowing you to quickly understand your current position, prioritizing focus and objectives-based deeper dive where you need it.
        
      `,
      bullets: [
        "Level 1 EAM RAM-GPS Awareness Assessment",
        "Power Ranking Prioritization",
        "Deep-Dive Focused Assessment",
        "Objectives / scenario driven strategy design",
       
      ],
  },
  {
    title: "Measures Architecture",
    content:
      "Define a practical KPI model that links operations, maintenance, and leadership decisions to one shared execution rhythm.",
      bullets: [
        "Level 1 EAM RAM-GPS Awareness Assessment",
        "Power Ranking Prioritization",
        "Deep-Dive Focused Assessment",
        "Objectives / scenario driven strategy design",
       
      ],
  },
  {
    title: "Measures Architecture",
    content:
      "Focused project to establish a measures framework architecture and serves as a powerful management tool, a “virtual twin” of your EAM program, providing valuable insight.",
    bullets: [
      "Measures Design Workshop",
      "360 Visualizer Software",
    
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Baselining Pilot Events",
    content: "At AX, Baselining is a process, a series of actions, a verb. It’s the discovery, analysis, evaluation and testing required to achieve the target technical end state Each 2-week event is a micro experience of a full-scale solution",
  bullets: [
      "EAM Program Assessment",
      "Reliability Strategies / PMO",
      "Work Management P&S",
       "Storeroom / Procurement",
      "I&E / Calibration",
      "Production Op-Ex",
    
    ],
 
  },
  {
    title: "Solution Deployment",
    content:
      `From successful Targeted Baselining Events to deployment of full-scale roll-out at the site or corporate levels
AX brings boots on the ground expertise, processes, tools and bandwidth to ensure maximum impact in the shortest time`,
  bullets: [
      "Project Design and Mgt.",
      "Training / Skills Transfer",
      "Coaching / Facilitation",
       "Turn-Key SME Deployment",
      "Off-Site Support Services",
      "Tools / Technology Licensing",
    
    ],
  },
    {
    title: "Data & Analytics",
    content:
      `Turning multiple data sources into analytics-ready information in an automated, documented, validated, process with a high degree of confidence. Bridging the gap between measures data and reporting requirements.`,
  bullets: [
      "Data Quality Gap Assessment",
      "Data Source Mapping",
      "Data Integrity Evaluation",
       "Data Alignment",
      "Quality Data Preparation",
      "Master Data Management",
      "Data Quality Monitoring",
    
    ],
  },
];

---




<Layout title="Our Approach">
  <div class="mx-auto text-center text-shadow-md">
    <HeroBanner
      class="min-h-100! lg:min-h-140!"
      height="lg"
      image="../../assets/images/approach-pgbg-02.jpg"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 w-1/3 m-auto mb-6">
        <hr class="flex-1 border border-sky-700" />

        <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">
          THE PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENT SYSTEM
        </span>

        <hr class="flex-1 border border-sky-700" />
      </div>
      <h1
        class="max-w-5xl m-auto text-6xl font-medium leading-tight text-white lg:text-6xl"
      >
        <span class="text-sky-800"> Our Approach</span>
        <br />
        <span class="block text-accent">
          The shortest distance from <br /> Data to Improvement
        </span>

        <!-- <span class="block text-white"> Reliability Improvement </span> -->
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-xl leading-8">
        Organized into an easy to navigate, comprehensive approach, each of 5
        focus disciplines complete the total analytics experience, enhancing
        maintenance reliability.
      </p>
    </HeroBanner>
  </div>
  <Section>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-1 gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-6">
        <p class="mb-6">
          With over 18 years helping companies advance their performance
          management programs, it became clear that there is a “secret formula”
          for those realizing their full potential. This truly is the shortest
          distance from data to improvement.
        </p>

        <p>
          The Power of our
          <strong>Asset Management Performance Improvement System:</strong>
          An organized and controlled approach that solves the challenges in each
          essential area of focus. Individually each domain solves local issues but
          when used together, become a management system for Performance Improvement
          at a program, site and personnel levels.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-6">
          The <strong>
            Asset Management Performance Improvement System
          </strong>, is the Total Performance Improvement System, representing a
          mature, effective and efficient future-state.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-6">
        <Heading level={4} class="text-accent">
          Start Anywhere – Go <br /> Everywhere!
        </Heading>
        <p>
          Maintenance and reliability professionals starting early in their
          journey approach the system as a process, working through the model in
          a strategic order having the system guide them to total control.
        </p>

        <p>
          Those who have an approach in various states of effectiveness and have
          specific objectives or problems to solve jump right to on a specific
          domain. The value we provide is in filling gaps in your performance
          management system to deliver the most effective system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <Heading level={4} class="text-accent">
          This percentage of clients experience these problems:
        </Heading>
        <div class="space-y-4 mt-6">
          <ProgressBar percentage={85} label="Reactive Maintenance" />
          <ProgressBar percentage={75} label="Disjointed Efforts / Silos" />
          <ProgressBar percentage={90} label="Data Quality" />
          <ProgressBar percentage={87} label="Reporting Limitations" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-1 gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="w-150 m-auto">
          <img   class="w-auto max-w-32"
            src="../../assets/images/pentagon-figures-semicircle.jpg"
            alt="Example image"
           
          />
      
            </div>
       

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 my-4">
           <Heading level={4} class="text-accent">
          <Eyebrow class="text-accent"
            >The Performance Improvement System</Eyebrow
          >
          Ed Stanek Discusses The Approach
        </Heading>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 items-center gap-2 mt-2 p-2 bg-slate-200 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-2xl">
            <p>
              COO of Asset Analytix, Ed was recently interviewed for a
              Reliability Leadership Institute podcast, discussing the unique
              Approach to maximizing maintenance reliability.
            </p>
            <img
              src={radioImage.src}
              alt="ReliabilityRadioweb logo"
              class="w-auto max-w-32"
            />
            <Audio
              src="/media/Asset_Analtyix_FINAL.mp3"
              controls={true}
              audioClass="w-full"
              wrapperClass="col-span-2"
            />
          </div>
         
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h1
        class="max-w-5xl m-auto text-6xl font-medium leading-tight text-white lg:text-6xl"
      >
        <span class="text-sky-800"> The Asset  
           <br>
               <span class="text-sky-800"> Management</span>
        </span>
        <br /> 
        <span class="block text-accent">
         Performance <br /> Improvement System
        </span>

        <!-- <span class="block text-white"> Reliability Improvement </span> -->
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto  leading-8">
       Organized into an easy to navigate, comprehensive approach, each of 5 focus disciplines complete the total analytics experience. While every organization has various aspects in place throughout the model, they struggle to complete the picture, maximizing their total potential.
      </p>
    
     <Accordion  items={accordionItems} bullets={} />
      </div>
    </div>
 


     

  </Section>
</Layout>
